          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A more effective chokepoint blockade that restricts outbound/inbound cargo directly prevents delivery of critical fab equipment, specialty gases and wafers to affected fabs, forcing production curtailments and reducing installed semiconductor capacity in the impacted jurisdiction." />
