          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter export controls create new cross‑border compliance rules and reporting requirements that force regulators to expand surveillance, audits and pre‑deployment checks of AI systems to ensure sanctions and licensing rules are met." />
