          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened export restrictions raise geopolitical and compliance risk for investors, prompting withdrawal or redirection of funding away from cross‑border AI projects and lowering net capital flows into affected AI development chains." />
