          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sudden increase in export controls raises regulatory and segmentation risk for targeted firms and sectors, provoking rapid portfolio reallocation and withdrawals by foreign investors which reduce net cross‑border capital inflows to the affected jurisdictions." />
