          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising cross-market volatility drives rapid portfolio rebalancing and risk-premia shifts in commodity desks and hedge funds, producing larger, more frequent swings in crude futures and thus higher oil-price volatility." />
