          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Elevated market volatility raises domestic economic and political pressures in allied countries, prompting some governments to prioritize internal stabilization over coordinated support for Ukraine and thereby weakening alliance cohesion." />
